Sat Oct 24 04:46:42 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 2026.04.0:
  * Library is now versioned 1.10.0, soname moved from 0 to 1
  * Reworked cache handling with new WITH_DCACHE option
  * Added virtio MMIO native transport layer support
  * Reintroduced zero-copy transmit and receive for RPMsg
  * Added TX buffer wait and endpoint-release callbacks
  * Added virtqueue RX-empty-notify and message buffer size APIs
  * Removed long-deprecated cmake options and APIs
  * CMake minimum raised to 3.16
  * Many bug fixes and maturity improvements
- Rename shared library package libopen_amp0 -> libopen_amp1
  following the upstream soname bump
- Drop examples subpackage: upstream removed the sample
  applications in 2025.04.0 (moved to openamp-system-reference)
- Drop obsolete patches, code was reworked upstream:
  * openamp-fix-build-with-libmetal.patch (apps tree is gone)
  * openamp-wait-when-no-more-buffer-avail.patch (TX buffer
    wait logic was reworked upstream with wait callbacks)
- Spec cleanup: use ldconfig_scriptlets macro, drop unused
  doxygen and graphviz BuildRequires, declare gcc and make
  explicitly (libhugetlbfs-devel and sysfsutils-devel are kept:
  libmetal's installed headers include them)

